### ============================================================================
### Payroll — HRIS Client API
### ============================================================================
# Click "Send Request" on Login first. REST Client automatically stores the
# token session cookie and replays it for the request below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000/api
@email = admin@company.com
@password = Password123!

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/_login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Get current salary for the logged-in employee
# @name currentSalary
GET {{baseUrl}}/salary/_current
